abstract: >-
  Actuarial formula cheat sheet created using LaTeX that includes
  essential formulas for actuarial science including probability
  distributions, life tables, annuities, insurance calculations,
  risk theory, and financial mathematics concepts used in actuarial
  practice. Available in French, English, and Spanish.
